---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Work | Marketing, Web Strategy & Writing Portfolio" description="Selected work across web management, marketing strategy, journalism, and photography.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative pt-40 pb-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="reveal text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-8">Work</p>
      <h1 class="reveal font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl text-neutral-100 leading-[1.05] mb-10">
        The work speaks.
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal text-neutral-400 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        A career that looks scattered on paper but follows one thread: show up, find the thing nobody's solving, figure it out.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Web & Marketing -->
  <section class="py-28 px-6 surface-1">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="space-y-16 reveal-stagger">
        <div class="reveal" style="--i:0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <p class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider">Current</p>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-neutral-100 text-2xl font-medium mb-1">SC Broadband</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mb-5">Marketing Representative, Cedar City, UT</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            My business card says "Marketing Representative." I'm the sole strategist, web developer, SEO strategist, and brand architect for a fiber cooperative serving 30,500 members across two states. Built the dual-brand strategy from scratch. Launched SEO and content from zero. Won four Best of Iron County golds. The title stopped being accurate about three months in.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gradient-divider"></div>

        <div class="reveal" style="--i:1">
          <h3 class="text-neutral-100 text-2xl font-medium mb-1">Truvy</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mb-5">Senior Director of Marketing, Draper, UT</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Health and wellness company in turnaround mode. $2.5M budget. Fifteen people across marketing, art, design, events, and PR. Moved NPS from 35 to 60. Increased brand recognition 33%. Six months. Long enough to prove the model. Short enough to know the company wasn't where I needed to be.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gradient-divider"></div>

        <div class="reveal" style="--i:2">
          <h3 class="text-neutral-100 text-2xl font-medium mb-1">MCC Apparel / H.M. Cole</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mb-5">Creative Director</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Dan McConkie hired me for photography and graphic design. Within months I was pulling data, building reports, running analytics, and influencing sales tactics. $90K budget. 120% sales increase. His reference letter says it better than I can: "We kept handing him hats and he kept wearing them."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gradient-divider"></div>

        <div class="reveal" style="--i:3">
          <h3 class="text-neutral-100 text-2xl font-medium mb-1">AllenComm</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mb-5">Technical Writer / Lead Copywriter</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Started as a technical writer. Ended up designing the SPTS online training program. 50,000 teachers completed it across the country. Won two awards. My supervisor's reference letter said I showed "some of the highest levels of creativity and productivity in my 20-year career." The car gets the awards. I got the check and the story.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Writing & Photography -->
  <section class="py-28 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="space-y-16 reveal-stagger">
        <div class="reveal" style="--i:0">
          <h3 class="text-neutral-100 text-2xl font-medium mb-1">Iron County Today</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mb-5">Staff Writer & Photographer</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            First real job that mattered. Covered news, politics, lifestyle, obituaries. Built the digital presence from nothing. Grew the online following 200% in six months. Won Utah Press Association Awards, though the awards went to the paper, not to me. I've always been the gas and the engine. The car gets the awards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gradient-divider"></div>

        <div class="reveal" style="--i:1">
          <h3 class="text-neutral-100 text-2xl font-medium mb-1">Standing Rock</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mb-5">Photojournalism, 2016 to 2017</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Filed dispatches from the camps in sub-zero wind, press badge from a FedEx in Bismarck. Some of the most important work I've done. Not for the portfolio, but for the reminder that showing up matters more than having a plan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gradient-divider"></div>

        <div class="reveal" style="--i:2">
          <h3 class="text-neutral-100 text-2xl font-medium mb-1">Mt. Rainier</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mb-5">Expedition Photographer, SummitClimb</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Published expedition photography with full credit. Field notes written at 12,000 feet in a tent that smelled like wet Gore-Tex and instant coffee. The best stories happen when you're too tired to make them up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="relative py-32 px-6 surface-1 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[500px] h-[300px] bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="reveal text-neutral-400 text-lg mb-10">Want to know more about a specific project or see writing samples? Just ask.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="reveal inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-amber-500 text-neutral-950 font-semibold text-sm rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-400 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(245,158,11,0.25)]">
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
